 yeah. Yeah."},{"p":83,"b":18,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Still in Chicago?"},{"p":83,"b":19,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Still in Chicago. Chicago was a good big town."},{"p":83,"b":20,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"He's got a good story, too. He's got a good background in Chicago, then, if he's been there all that time."},{"p":84,"b":0,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. He's been there since --"}]}